A","children":[]},{"id":"165","parent":"162","text":"Analisis interacciones (Lexicomp, Micromedex)","guid":"ljr6ZJWES6G39gZ11lEQdg","children":[]}]},{"id":"166","parent":"157","text":"Minimo esencial sin omitir lo beneficioso","guid":"4SUwLqevTg2To2pStkTS1w","children":[{"id":"167","parent":"166","text":"Anticoagulacion en FA","guid":"p_pLyjroTpu14bMiEEOzyQ","children":[]},{"id":"168","parent":"166","text":"ARNI/SGLT2 en IC con beneficio claro","guid":"z4xvvL58QTurxtW4CBVmjA","children":[]}]}]},{"id":"169","parent":"0","text":"Pronostico y tiempo hasta beneficio","guid":"3wJOcNr5QQqu3ezjspZPOg","children":[{"id":"170","parent":"169","text":"ePrognosis (eprognosis.ucsf.edu)","guid":"rgpXJSvXRSqy02L6vHC3bQ","children":[{"id":"171","parent":"170","text":"Meta-herramienta segun setting","guid":"5aZ4QEceQUaaZTMYmbzLpg","children":[]},{"id":"172","parent":"170","text":"Hospitalizado/ambulatorio/paliativo","guid":"LUerUBXoQNG9BH0BtSePpA","children":[]}]},{"id":"173","parent":"169","text":"Estratificacion por pronostico","guid":"y4j_kqQ0Q0qCv7Qa5Plg6g","children":[{"id":"174","parent":"173","text":"Robusto sobrevida mayor 10 anos (prevencion primaria activa)","guid":"3zZVZr-8TXmCX5V5K7mw_g","children":[]},{"id":"175","parent":"173","text":"Intermedio 2-10 anos (hibrido, caso a caso)","guid":"lrphrb5kRoyDPJsIsvsPOA","children":[]},{"id":"176","parent":"173","text":"Fragil/dependencia menor 2 anos (calidad de vida, confort)","guid":"qVvtH0MRRw2Ok8k7_xbnCA","children":[]}]},{"id":"177","parent":"169","text":"Time-to-benefit (REGLA PRACTICA)","guid":"9H0nhulKQxCdtC2RQEUQoQ","children":[{"id":"178","parent":"177","text":"Si TIME-TO-BENEFIT mayor expectativa de vida -> NO aporta -> deprescribir","guid":"FdcYFSmrShiz90kxBHU-Pw","children":[]},{"id":"179","parent":"177","text":"Si expectativa vida mayor TTB -> tratamiento razonable","guid":"tt5GgimFSA-Fv6qXlobKtA","children":[]}]},{"id":"180","parent":"169","text":"Ejemplos","guid":"91sYwAN9T4Gwuso8nnShxA","children":[{"id":"181","parent":"180","text":"Estatina prevencion primaria TTB 2-5 anos -> suspender si menor 2a","guid":"55l2lXx0R0uvkNMCYOGlNg","children":[]},{"id":"182","parent":"180","text":"Bifosfonatos TTB 12-18 meses -> reevaluar","guid":"G1-JcJxPQLKtHfobzqmwtA","children":[]},{"id":"183","parent":"180","text":"Control glicemico intensivo TTB 8-10 anos -> liberar metas","guid":"sCMZuIKRRyuWOR_3cqIijA","children":[]},{"id":"184","parent":"180","text":"Anticoagulacion en FA TTB semanas-meses -> mantener","guid":"JjS4r4KpRPSijvb9cdZZXQ","children":[]}]}]},{"id":"185","parent":"0","text":"Coordinacion asistencial","guid":"l2ijGQoIRkuPfdy_sazB3w","children":[{"id":"186","parent":"185","text":"Atencion primaria como coordinadora del flujo","guid":"_odJZ18JSECIntCa1bzAEw","children":[]},{"id":"187","parent":"185","text":"Recepcion oportuna de informacion de especialistas","guid":"0D3Vl72-SBS_Kmu_e4fN5A","children":[]},{"id":"188","parent":"185","text":"Coordinacion con hospitalizacion + apoyo domiciliario","guid":"zAglP9PmRXS_G7yzdEFeJQ","children":[]},{"id":"189","parent":"185","text":"Conversaciones de planificacion anticipada antes de evento agudo","guid":"03RcEVmkTsOCkjLAGt-y9w","children":[]}]},{"id":"190","parent":"0","text":"Tips de cierre","guid":"pRr-azXSRHi-9yfG3bvF3A","children":[{"id":"191","parent":"190","text":"Screening oncologico tiene FECHA DE CADUCIDAD","guid":"0J-xUoRYRz6heDaN6dniRw","children":[{"id":"192","parent":"191","text":"No PAP, colonoscopia, TAC pulmonar en mayor 90 con pronostico meses","guid":"Jg0GdcMSSfW6t4zxLjuqow","children":[]}]},{"id":"193","parent":"190","text":"Medidas no farmacologicas transversales","guid":"ZxSDI8sxQJmhpliBVHwuPw","children":[{"id":"194","parent":"193","text":"Nutricion, actividad fisica, manejo estres cuidador","guid":"RiVUmfQ9TwOaWNgV9DQXjg","children":[]}]},{"id":"195","parent":"190","text":"No solo dejar de hacer","guid":"Ap6bXfZxQBu5RDXAnNtbeA","children":[{"id":"196","parent":"195","text":"Tambien hacer lo que beneficia","guid":"tDeBpl3oSSqnTeqfIt_6iQ","children":[]},{"id":"197","parent":"195","text":"ARNI/SGLT2 en IC, anticoagulacion FA, vit D en osteoporosis","guid":"Lc9MgqsDQzefoXXaMCiTzQ","children":[]}]}]},{"id":"198","parent":"0","text":"Perlas Clinicas","guid":"6tbxV0vkQCGczUemMLR8rQ","children":[{"id":"199","parent":"198","text":"Perla 1 Multimorbilidad pone PERSONA en centro -> reorganizar todo el acto medico","guid":"cw8jo2PRQLuK8m6ZgyBfeg","children":[]},{"id":"200","parent":"198","text":"Perla 2 Guias clinicas FALLAN sistematicamente en multimorbilidad -> leer con ojo critico siempre","guid":"0JBMVa1ITYurmT1LSmPtOg","children":[]},{"id":"201","parent":"198","text":"Perla 3 Paciente DEL MEDIO es el desafio real (ni fit joven ni paliativo terminal)","guid":"hP_ENzhORtyvg282RDvj0A","children":[]},{"id":"202","parent":"198","text":"Perla 4 Multimorbilidad DIFERENTE Fragilidad (Fried 2001) -> camello carga vs capacidad de cargar","guid":"uMn7J41nQ2eDmIo4fnvZGA","children":[]},{"id":"203","parent":"198","text":"Perla 5 Brecha socioeconomica adelanta multimorbilidad ~10 anos -> determinante social en primera consulta","guid":"Rh6CMxYXQ8SxoWkzGNP5iw","children":[]},{"id":"204","parent":"198","text":"Perla 6 Sindrome de los trinchiflados es fantasia -> enfermedades y tratamientos COMPITEN","guid":"JAog6sMUQ_2gvwWwGiYsFw","children":[]},{"id":"205","parent":"198","text":"Perla 7 Balanza de carga del tratamiento -> plan brillante en papel no sirve si paciente no puede","guid":"zIiLeNwmRheN8YY9MEJlBA","children":[]},{"id":"206","parent":"198","text":"Perla 8 Time-to-benefit mayor expectativa de vida -> DEPRESCRIBIR (regla simple y poderosa)","guid":"MIa7zxjhSnmvvRznfOAo9g","children":[]},{"id":"207","parent":"198","text":"Perla 9 Primera pregunta QUE ES IMPORTANTE PARA USTED -> brujula del plan","guid":"mDwvM52pRHG358N3Wb7T5w","children":[]},{"id":"208","parent":"198","text":"Perla 10 Proceso es CICLICO no lineal -> cada control revaluar","guid":"tOVU-hD-R5uyFlEhLLxD4A","children":[]},{"id":"209","parent":"198","text":"Perla 11 Ninguna escala (Charlson, CIRS-G) basta como base unica","guid":"KLzu_3PuQjOnU03nOIJ62g","children":[]},{"id":"210","parent":"198","text":"Perla 12 No solo deprescribir, tambien prescribir lo beneficioso (anticoag FA, ARNI/SGLT2)","guid":"1cgjWfLbRzGzGZZnXFf2eA","children":[]}]},{"id":"211","parent":"0","text":"Evidencia complementaria (papers oficiales)","guid":"DOqpV9Q7Sfq--OrjvXdQNA","children":[{"id":"212","parent":"211","text":"Skou y cols (Nat Rev Dis Primers 2022;8:48) multimorbidity primer","guid":"DgM11iEbSoOihh-vaBjBoQ","children":[{"id":"213","parent":"212","text":"Definicion WHO mayor o igual 2 condiciones cronicas coexistentes","guid":"e1SUuSkTQg-ypP46qvh14g","children":[]},{"id":"214","parent":"212","text":"Multimorbilidad aparece ~1 decada antes en comunidades socioeconomicamente deprivadas","guid":"TXct5b7NSrqVCIE_Opm-lw","children":[]},{"id":"215","parent":"212","text":"En numeros absolutos mas pacientes menor 65 anos tienen multimorbilidad que mayor 65 (mas gente joven en general)","guid":"O_njeJisRDyVcKKygiGIVg","children":[]},{"id":"216","parent":"212","text":"Asociada a muerte prematura, peor funcionalidad, peor HRQoL, mayor utilizacion sanitaria","guid":"qM-cszf_SFWqgzF-f_1oJQ","children":[]},{"id":"217","parent":"212","text":"Definicion alternativa multimorbilidad COMPLEJA mayor o igual 3 condiciones afectando mayor o igual 3 sistemas","guid":"y5VQRQ2EQua1Ob6CAXCktQ","children":[]},{"id":"218","parent":"212","text":"Atencion debe ser centrada-persona, coordinada y MINIMAMENTE DISRUPTIVA","guid":"5hkP_GmlQC2D1gVU5SI5fw","children":[]},{"id":"219","parent":"212","text":"Evidencia para intervenciones todavia limitada -> mas investigacion y reconfiguracion del sistema urgentes","guid":"qPBpMA4eQXm8DNgikieS0g","children":[]}]},{"id":"220","parent":"211","text":"Salisbury y cols (Lancet 2018;392:41-50) 3D approach trial","guid":"531NagQJQ2e6JqOqr4gpvA","children":[{"id":"221","parent":"220","text":"RCT pragmatico cluster-randomizado 1546 pacientes en 33 practicas (Inglaterra y Escocia)","guid":"vR0hj7fgQISroi_QKMSAOA","children":[]},{"id":"222","parent":"220","text":"Intervencion 3D revisiones cada 6 meses (dimensions of health, depression, drugs)","guid":"mNE42vYpSlSbgS0Z_gmspQ","children":[]},{"id":"223","parent":"220","text":"Outcome primario calidad de vida EQ-5D-5L a 15 meses","guid":"hYYif9yiQLa42BzkBg8Pvw","children":[]},{"id":"224","parent":"220","text":"Diferencia ajustada 0,00 (IC95 -0,02 a 0,02; p=0,93) -> NULL RESULT","guid":"9vRFzMrYQ_-oy89lgLtyNQ","children":[]},{"id":"225","parent":"220","text":"El mayor trial de consenso internacional para multimorbilidad NO mejoro calidad de vida","guid":"5yV-yZPoSJKnaf7sxq4vdg","children":[]},{"id":"226","parent":"220","text":"Implicancia el concepto es correcto pero como operacionalizarlo en AP sigue sin resolverse","guid":"Joslb5B1SG2fY7TUcmUtsQ","children":[]}]},{"id":"227","parent":"211","text":"Calderon-Larranaga y cols (Lancet Healthy Longev 2025;6:100790) trajectory framework","guid":"sarHH4NrQiKbcSSjKwwDCA","children":[{"id":"228","parent":"227","text":"Prevalencia multimorbilidad 50+ anos en 15 paises Europa rango 24,7% a 55,6%","guid":"BE4wAct2Sy2QFIIVlLapZQ","children":[]},{"id":"229","parent":"227","text":"Paradigm shift transversal a LONGITUDINAL (trayectorias)","guid":"Yk6mNtJ6TK-T8vbAB7IbDQ","children":[]},{"id":"230","parent":"227","text":"Rastrear secuencia, pace y severidad de acumulacion -> mecanismos + intervencion temprana","guid":"QVybsjG8RZ-IaCOXvtyUOA","children":[]},{"id":"231","parent":"227","text":"Acumulacion rapida de enfermedades sirve como biomarcador dinamico de deterioro","guid":"lshC2iixQBiHudSZBEQETw","children":[]},{"id":"232","parent":"227","text":"Estatinas en alta dosis se asocian a aumento de incidencia DM (cascada iatrogenica)","guid":"5nLpSQAmRwCbqrZu5Huh6g","children":[]}]},{"id":"233","parent":"211","text":"Wilkinson y Preston (Clin Integr Care 2021;5) 5-step approach","guid":"_pAyedfyQQy2tuD46aXzgw","children":[{"id":"234","parent":"233","text":"Prevalencia frailty + multimorbidity en poblacion general ~6%","guid":"XvIJXTlESp2kSqOyz7whig","children":[]},{"id":"235","parent":"233","text":"Entre fragiles 50-70% tienen multimorbilidad","guid":"OHJ4zA-rR7m1c_PWFc4mbw","children":[]},{"id":"236","parent":"233","text":"Entre multimorbidos ~1 de 5 tienen fragilidad","guid":"hbet9VZiSLC0EgbVlA6D7w","children":[]},{"id":"237","parent":"233","text":"Mujer 78a con IAM previo + DM2 + artrosis + EPOC + depresion guias UK -> al menos 11 farmacos + hasta 10 adicionales + 9 cambios estilo vida + 8-10 controles AP fisicos + 4-6 salud mental + 8-30 intervenciones psicosociales","guid":"7bpBr3GXQ4O3J7EQfHl3jw","children":[]},{"id":"238","parent":"233","text":"5 pasos clinica (1) explicar proposito enfoque (2) cargas enfermedad y tratamiento (3) metas/valores/prioridades (4) revision farmacos (5) plan individualizado","guid":"CtbERCEWRGOLTXpZdt8X0A","children":[]}]}]},{"id":"239","parent":"0","text":"Conceptos examinados (Evaluaciones SGGCh 2026)","guid":"O-ofIhpeQXyPIkF_6IwOMg","children":[{"id":"240","parent":"239","text":"Evaluacion M1","guid":"S1csmPzuQqWyJj_HPSHUIw","children":[{"id":"241","parent":"240","text":"Q3 Paciente con expectativa de vida menor 2 anos -> PALIAR sintomas y calidad sobre cantidad; control glicemico estricto TTB mayor 10 anos NO aplica; guias monopatologia tampoco","guid":"V4MiaWj9SEiEoyqOQBZSMg","children":[]},{"id":"242","parent":"240","text":"Q11 Principio AGS #1 = preferencias del PACIENTE al centro (marco ciclico preferencias -> evidencia -> riesgo/beneficio -> factibilidad -> decision); ignorar/persuadir = mala praxis","guid":"Oq57h_6oTgeZ3aQDJhdoaw","children":[]},{"id":"243","parent":"240","text":"Q15 RCTs EXCLUYEN sistematicamente AM con multimorbilidad/fragilidad/polifarmacia -> evidencia no generalizable -> aplicar guias mecanicamente = iatrogenia","guid":"A1BuQtgtT5CuGHJJQ52Elw","children":[]}]}]},{"id":"244","parent":"0","text":"Preguntas Autoestudio (oficiales Dr Senn)","guid":"ufJZcBdKT5eBYk2I0iZuhg","children":[{"id":"245","parent":"244","text":"Cuales son las diferencias entre los terminos de comorbilidad y multimorbilidad y que relevancia clinica tiene diferenciarlos","guid":"93JsDMIRQcOysxSlDipBGQ","children":[]},{"id":"246","parent":"244","text":"Cual es el primer paso a la hora de intervenir a un paciente con multimorbilidad","guid":"khANpwB-TFCjf6w6Memahg","children":[]},{"id":"247","parent":"244","text":"Cual es la relevancia de distinguir fragilidad de comorbilidad","guid":"HXoRXISJQbW-sYwQLxQWgg","children":[]}]},{"id":"248","parent":"0","text":"Referencias (oficiales del curso)","guid":"ZSczW4VuTU2VL5T_ylkwaw","children":[{"id":"249","parent":"248","text":"1. AGS Expert Panel. Guiding principles for the care of older adults with multimorbidity. JAGS 2012;60(10):1957-68.","guid":"gFLcudGqRuycdi-zbU6fIg","children":[]},{"id":"250","parent":"248","text":"2. NICE Guideline NG56. Multimorbidity: clinical assessment and management. London: NICE; 2016.","guid":"l6khmv6hQ8-4BKsQ6cqOGg","children":[]},{"id":"251","parent":"248","text":"3. Skou ST, Mair FS, Fortin M, et al. Multimorbidity. Nat Rev Dis Primers 2022;8(1):48.","guid":"Wx-mAGFbT1Om1r7cDCidcg","children":[]},{"id":"252","parent":"248","text":"4. Salisbury C, Man MS, Bower P, et al. Management of multimorbidity using a patient-centred care model: a pragmatic cluster-randomised trial of the 3D approach. Lancet 2018;392(10141):41-50.","guid":"VhxzgMF9S36A3WHCrhJ_vg","children":[]},{"id":"253","parent":"248","text":"5. Calderon-Larranaga A, Fabbri E, Gonzalez AI, et al. Understanding changes in complex care needs over time: key research insights into multimorbidity trajectories. Lancet Healthy Longev 2025;6:100790.","guid":"zKiWoAlwQhqvyKEdLn4xrw","children":[]},{"id":"254","parent":"248","text":"6. Wilkinson I, Preston J. Managing patients with multimorbidity. Clin Integr Care 2021;5 (S2666-8696[21]00011-7).","gu